      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The authors briefly describe the principal late complications of ileo-anal anastomoses: anal fistulae, anal strictures, bowel obstruction, gallstones, renal stones, desmoid tumours. The aetiological hypotheses and the therapeutic possibilities are analysed for each complication."},
